Before running, make sure ALL_USA_TRAINING_DATA.csv is in the folder

======= US_LSTM_test_sampling.py =======
is used to test several sampling methods
This will save the results of each method as a csv file (but I haven't used it for hyperparameter tuning yet)

======= US_LSTM_SUS_ClassWeight.py =======
is the version that performs the final selection of sampling methods on the US dataset
Finally, the trained model based on the US dataset will be saved as usa_lstm_model.h5

======= US_LSTM_ensemble.py =======
is the version used for the ensemble model

======= main.py =======
is a possible usage of the LSTM class...